# Thornpan Delta: a ring round the dry delta, crossing its channels like
# the spokes of a wheel. Units in metres: x east, z south.
#
# North up the west leg over three small channels, east along the north
# leg over the main channel (a single pad, a kicker on the near bank, a
# rocky shoal beside it for anyone who misses), south down the fault trough
# between its two rock walls, round Lamp Kopje on a broad banked circle and
# west past the salt pans to the line. The flood comes down during the
# race: the channels are dry sand on lap 1, fords on lap 2, and on lap 3
# the main channel runs too deep to drive.
track thornpan_delta size 768 style savanna
title THORNPAN DELTA
blurb A ring round a dry delta in the cool season, crossing its channels like the spokes of a wheel. The flood comes down during the race: dry sand on the first lap, fords on the second, and on the last the main channel is jumped or waded.
race laps 3 rivals 5 vehicle kart
road 16 bank 1.3
land 30 2.5
hour 16
materials verge white_sand

